#: ../../source/index.rst:2
msgid "QuSpect Documentation"
msgstr "QuSpect 文档"

#: ../../source/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"QuSpect is a quantum computing SDK for research and education. It "
"provides an intuitive Python API for constructing quantum circuits, "
"building DAG-based intermediate representations, and preparing for "
"simulation and hardware execution."
msgstr ""
"QuSpect 是一个面向科研与教学的量子计算 SDK。它提供直观的 Python API，用于构建量子线路、构建基于 DAG "
"的中间表示，并为模拟和硬件执行做好准备。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Sample quantum circuit — 4-qubit circuit with Hadamard, CNOT, Toffoli, "
"SWAP, barriers, and measurements"
msgstr "示例量子线路——包含 Hadamard、CNOT、Toffoli、SWAP、屏障和测量的 4 量子比特线路"

#: ../../source/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"A 4-qubit quantum circuit showcasing single-qubit gates (H, X, T), two-"
"qubit gates (CNOT), three-qubit gate (CCX/Toffoli), SWAP, barrier, and "
"measurement, rendered as a scalable SVG diagram."
msgstr ""
"一个 4 "
"量子比特量子线路，展示了单量子比特门（H、X、T）、双量子比特门（CNOT）、三量子比特门（CCX/Toffoli）、SWAP、屏障和测量，并以可缩放的"
" SVG 图呈现。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"Sample sampling result — Bell state measurement distribution with "
"statistical summary"
msgstr "示例采样结果——Bell 态测量分布及统计摘要"

#: ../../source/index.rst:22
msgid ""
"Measurement sampling result from a Bell state circuit (1024 shots), "
"displaying outcome distribution as a gradient bar chart with built-in "
"statistical annotations (entropy, variance, top-gap, effective rank)."
msgstr "Bell 态线路的测量采样结果（1024 次采样），以渐变条形图展示结果分布，并内置统计标注（熵、方差、top-gap、有效秩）。"

